 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "A roundabout. Busy, as always. But the traffic looks a little fluffy.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "It's a hundred sheep. And the sheepdog is in charge. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers just squeeze in. Right between the sheep.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "Big mistake. The sheepdog counts its flock. Ninety-nine. A hundred. A hundred and one?",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "Now you're sheep number one hundred and one. Round and round, lap after lap. Then it herds you home. Into the pen. With an ear tag.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Roll down the window, and count the sheep. Out loud. Nice and slowly.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "One sheep. Two sheep. Three sheep. They start to yawn.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "By ten, the whole flock is fast asleep. One big fluffy cloud, right in the middle.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "Even the sheepdog. Snoring, right on top.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "Indicate. Second exit. Very, very quietly.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: the train is a caterpillar. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
